 hour doesn't seem like much but I'm the sole supporter at the moment for a family of 7 and it's going to make a small, but huge difference for us. Please and thank you!", "candidate_role": "counterevidence", "candidate_warrant": "Cited as a boundary case or counterexample.", "display_order": 4, "excerpt_id": "EXC_affbbb85d3dded7f", "local_context": null, "source_id": "SRC_ec246f3d5dbde277", "speaker_id": null, "text": "Here's the link to my amazon wish list where the two items are: <url> If the link doesn't work, let me know. The extra $1.25 an hour doesn't seem like much but I'm the sole supporter at the moment for a family of 7 and it's going to make a small, but huge difference for us. Please and thank you!"}, {"candidate_attributed_excerpt_id": "EXC_9ba414c78f9e6971", "candidate_attributed_source_id": "SRC_72fb88f0abd68187", "candidate_attributed_speaker_id": null, "candidate_quote": "Hey guys. This post is primarily obsession and compulsion orientated. I did want to post in the OCD sr but it’s pretty quiet in there. I’m a 19 year old male from the UK and in terms of my anxiety, this has truly been the worst year of my life. My most common obsession theme throughout my life has been to do with my health but for the last two years I have been dominated by intrusive thoughts about being a homosexual when I’m not and being a pedophile.", "candidate_role": "support", "candidate_warrant": "Cited as direct support for the interpretation.", "display_order": 5, "excerpt_id": "EXC_9ba414c78f9e6971", "local_context": null, "source_id": "SRC_72fb88f0abd68187", "speaker_id": null, "text": "Hey guys. This post is primarily obsession and compulsion orientated. I did want to post in the OCD sr but it’s pretty quiet in there. I’m a 19 year old male from the UK and in terms of my anxiety, this has truly been the worst year of my life. My most common obsession theme throughout my life has been to do with my health but for the last two years I have been dominated by intrusive thoughts about being a homosexual when I’m not and being a pedophile."}, {"candidate_attributed_excerpt_id": null, "candidate_attributed_source_id": null, "candidate_attributed_speaker_id": null, "candidate_quote": null, "candidate_role": "context_only", "candidate_warrant": null, "display_order": 6, "excerpt_id": "EXC_2c64703299fe58ac", "local_context": null, "source_id": "SRC_c5ac430998fe0e88", "speaker_id": null, "text": "i have horrible vivid nightmares every night. sometimes they're trauma related, but most of the time they're about murder, torture and such depraved things that I can't talk about to anyone. every morning i wake up drenched in sweat, and sometimes vomiting. i have no idea what to do. it's ruining my life."}], "item_id": "DJI_a71072482292241d", "item_schema_version": "direction-j-evaluator-item-v1", "output_id": "OUT_a71072482292241d", "packet_id": "PKT_d2944889887174f0", "proposed_interpretation": {"boundary_conditions": ["stress", "anxiety"], "claim": "People describe stress as overwhelming, complex, and traumatic.", "explanation": "The excerpts suggest that people experience stress as a burden that is difficult to manage. For example, in EXC_5d88a6b25bf1def4, the speaker describes feeling overwhelmed by their situation and unsure of how to cope. Similarly, in EXC_9ba414c78f9e6971, the speaker describes experiencing intrusive thoughts and anxiety that have been dominating their life.", "theme_id": "THM_a71072482292241d", "theme_name": "stress"}, "research_question": "How do people describe and contextualize experiences of stress?", "source_coverage": {"candidate_cited_excerpt_count": 3, "candidate_cited_source_count": 3, "coverage_note": "Counts describe only this restricted private packet.", "presented_excerpt_count": 6, "presented_source_count": 6, "sampling_frame_excerpt_count": 6, "sampling_frame_source_count": 6, "source_distribution": [{"candidate_cited_excerpt_count": 0, "presented_excerpt_count": 1, "source_id": "SRC_36f07a147502b213"}, {"